# The finale the walkthrough garbled, reconstructed from the
# game's own source. Three interlocking gates: (1) shake the guy
# wires -- never mentioned by any walkthrough -- to flush Mahler
# from his perch onto the far platform (carry the radio: left on
# that platform, he lands on it, "Crunch!"); (2) walk the rope to
# the halfway point so the radio is close enough to hear WPDL's
# fund appeal break into the music -- that announcement is what
# makes the station's phone line answerable; (3) retreat, pledge
# by phone from the Office, then cross again: the announcer plays
# her withheld Vivaldi, and at the fifth step the becalmed ape
# releases Chelsea into the net.
climb stand
up
take radio
shake the guy wires
